# Agent skills
# `.agents/skills/` and skills-lock.json are committed so the skills travel
# with the project. `.claude/skills/` only holds symlinks into `.agents/`, and
# they store absolute paths from the machine that ran `npx skills add`, so
# committing them would bake one person's home directory into the repo. The
# rest of `.claude/`, the subagents and the hook that guards one of them, is
# ordinary project configuration and is committed.
/.claude/skills/
